  <DT> <H2> <font color="yellow">Future </font></H2>

    <font color="white"> 
<UL>
  <LI>Astronomy: Next-generation fully photonic miniaturized filters, spectrometers, and nulling interferometers "on-a-chip" for Extremely Large Telescopes (ELTs) and Space Missions <BR>
<UL>
  <LI> High-contrast (60-80 dB) NIR nulling interferometers<BR>
  <LI> High-resolution (R = &lambda; / &delta; &lambda; > 50,000 - 100,000) NIR spectroscopy<BR>
  <LI> Highly multiplexed UVOIR wide-field two-dimensional imaging spectroscopy ("integral field spectroscopy" or IFS) <BR>
  <LI> Highly multiplexed UVOIR multi-object spectroscopy (or MOS)<BR>
<UL>
</UL>
</UL>
  <LI> Other Applications<BR>
<UL>
  <LI> Greenhouse gas measurements, biophotonics, biomedical analysis, microfluidics, petrochemistry, and telecommunication itself. <BR>
</UL>
</UL>
